# _rl_sonder.inc - Special modules outside the simulator catalog (scripts_src/headers/rl_sonder.h)
# Names 430 + id, effects 530 + id. Plain ASCII only.
{430}{}{The Hidden Room}
{530}{}{A room behind a false wall that nobody in the Den knows about. Runaways can hide there, and Metzger's men won't find them when they search. Upkeep +$25/week.}
{431}{}{The Jet Counter}
{531}{}{A counter behind the bar where the Mordinos' Jet changes hands. +$6 side income per customer. Twice as many of our people get hooked, and the Wrights will never forgive it: Jet killed Richard Wright. Upkeep +$25/week.}
{432}{}{The Rigged Scale}
{532}{}{The same brass scale, with a weight inside the pan that nobody sees. Every miner pays a little more gold than he owes. Revenue +15%, karma -2 a week, heat +10. If Sheriff Marion finds it, the miners will tear the place apart. Rules out the honest scale.}
